        "created_at": "2013-06-05T22:26:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Alright, I know you guys aren't supposed to give away information really, but... could anyone say the rough distribution of the complexity of the new heroes? Is it going to be some easier ones? Maybe something even more confusing (and interesting) than AZ or AA?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As for the villains, well, we already know who they are, and I'm assuming they can still be challenged individually, what about their difficulty? Hard? Medium? Easy? Absurd?</p>",
